y servants","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"39:18","t":"Who listen to speech and follow the best of it. Those are the ones Allāh has guided, and those are people of understanding.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"39:19","t":"Then, is one who has deserved the decree of punishment [to be guided]? Then, can you save one who is in the Fire?","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"39:20","t":"But those who have feared their Lord - for them are chambers, above them chambers built high, beneath which rivers flow. [This is] the promise of Allāh. Allāh does not fail in [His] promise.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"39:21","t":"Do you not see that Allāh sends down rain from the sky and makes it flow as springs [and rivers] in the earth; then He produces thereby crops of varying colors; then they dry and you see them turned yellow; then He makes them [scattered] debris. Indeed in that is a reminder for those of understanding.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":21,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":46,"surahs":[39],"sajdah":false}